{"id":239160,"shortDescription":"Garrett, el maestro de ladrones, abandona las sombras para adentrarse en la Ciudad. Mientras la milicia del Barón siembra el terror y la opresión, una misteriosa enfermedad azota las calles. Bajo las órdenes de Orión, la voz del pueblo, los ciudadanos se preparan para una sangrienta revolución.","developers":["Eidos-Montréal","Feral Interactive (Mac)"],"publishers":["Eidos Interactive Corp.","Feral Interactive (Mac)"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Controles de volumen personalizados","Dificultad ajustable","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualSense","Sonido estéreo","Opciones de subtítulos","Steam Cloud","Tablas de clasificación de Steam","Remote Play en TV","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"27 FEB 2014","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/239160?t=1780670514","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/ss_b40d2b3cf97b4a38f7d3bf896f9339a33886c0ff.600x338.jpg?t=1780670514","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/ss_b40d2b3cf97b4a38f7d3bf896f9339a33886c0ff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780670514"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/ss_b56f3d8c4a96f2fb9e5edee81fde0c3ebf48c0b3.600x338.jpg?t=1780670514","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/ss_b56f3d8c4a96f2fb9e5edee81fde0c3ebf48c0b3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780670514"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/ss_f415a948f5aed71b8d69e8dae97fac30cc82cfd1.600x338.jpg?t=1780670514","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/ss_f415a948f5aed71b8d69e8dae97fac30cc82cfd1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780670514"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/239160/ss_5dd761ac579348371230ca313d7ade06a9931aa9.600x3